sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Surface as Studio Surface
  participant Resolver as Target Resolver
  participant Picker as Single Epic Picker
  participant Builder as Prompt Context Builder
  participant Launcher as Shared Launcher
  participant Prompt as Prompt Dialog
  participant Agent as Agent Picker
  participant Terminal as Terminal Store
  participant Panel as Scratch Terminal Panel

  User->>Surface: Invoke create
  Surface->>Resolver: create request + surface context
  alt exactly one epic/module implied
    Resolver-->>Builder: module context
  else no epic or multiple epics
    Resolver->>Picker: ask for one epic
    User->>Picker: choose epic
    Picker-->>Builder: module context
  end
  Builder-->>Launcher: initialPrompt + advisory context
  alt no typed prompt
    Launcher->>Prompt: collect prompt
    User->>Prompt: submit
    Prompt-->>Agent: prompt payload
  else typed prompt exists
    Launcher->>Agent: prompt payload
  end
  User->>Agent: choose agent
  Agent->>Terminal: openSession(taskId null, isPlanning true)
  Terminal-->>Panel: session id
  Panel-->>User: visible scratch terminal
